@startuml
title Жизненный цикл Knowledge ingestion

actor "Менеджер / Supervisor / Admin" as Manager
participant "support-admin Server Action" as Action
database "KB article RPC" as ArticleRpc
database "knowledge_base_articles" as Articles
database "knowledge_base_history" as History
database "knowledge_chunk_sets" as ChunkSets
participant "kb-ingestion" as Ingestion
participant "Hugging Face Embeddings" as HF
database "knowledge_chunks" as Chunks
participant "kb-embedding-refresh-batch" as Batch
database "knowledge_embedding_refresh_batches/items" as BatchTables

Manager -> Action: create/update/publish article
Action -> ArticleRpc: create_kb_article_v1 / update_kb_article_v1
ArticleRpc -> Articles: write article version
ArticleRpc -> History: append history
ArticleRpc -> ChunkSets: ensure pending chunk set, если article не archived
Action -> Ingestion: invoke mode=webhook, chunk_set_id

Ingestion -> ChunkSets: claim + heartbeat
Ingestion -> Ingestion: build retrieval chunks
Ingestion -> HF: embedding batches
HF --> Ingestion: vector(384) arrays
Ingestion -> Chunks: complete_kb_chunk_set_ingestion writes chunks
Ingestion -> ChunkSets: mark completed and switch active set

Manager -> Action: start mass refresh
Action -> BatchTables: create_kb_embedding_refresh_batch_v1
Action -> Batch: invoke batch worker
Batch -> BatchTables: claim item
Batch -> ChunkSets: request/reuse pending chunk set
Batch -> Ingestion: invoke chunk-set ingestion
Batch -> BatchTables: finish item + recalculate totals

@enduml
